  "line": "    mozilla::gfx::StealthMarkUserPrefsRead();  // STEALTH-HOOK(platform/declaration-gate)",
  "test": "gtest:StealthGfxFeatureStatus.NothingProbesTheHostBeforeTheProfilePrefsAreRead",
  "anchor": "`StealthLockIcePrefs();` (network/proxy-udp), right after `mDirProvider.InitializeUserPrefs();` of XREMain::XRE_mainRun",
