  "line": "    mozilla::widget::StealthFireHostGLProbeIfStock();  // STEALTH-HOOK(platform/declaration-gate)",
  "test": "gtest:StealthGfxFeatureStatus.TheHostProbeIsLaunchedAsSoonAsThePrefsAreReadWithTheEngineOff",
  "anchor": "`mozilla::gfx::StealthMarkUserPrefsRead();` (platform/declaration-gate), right after `mDirProvider.InitializeUserPrefs();` of XREMain::XRE_mainRun",
