  "kind": "add",
  "form": "anchor",
  "line": "  if (gfx::StealthFillGtkGfxInfoWithoutHost(mTestType, mGlxTestError, mAdapterRAM, mIsWayland, mIsXWayland)) return;  // STEALTH-HOOK(platform/declaration-gate)",
  "test": "gtest:StealthGfxFeatureStatus.TheHostIsNotProbedWhileDeclared",
  "anchor": "GfxInfoBase::GetData();",
  "why": "GfxInfo::GetData sets mInitialized and runs GfxInfoBase::GetData() before; a guard in the head would skip both, and the five fields it fills (test type, glxtest error, adapter RAM, the two display flags) are the ones the glxtest parse below would otherwise write."
 },
